title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6 if next_election_time - time > 6 and not (year == 1928 and month == 1); rally_timer = 2 if (year == 1928 and month == 1) or (next_election_time - time <= 6)
card-image: img/es/events/asturias_1934.jpg
go-to: main_rally; sa_disrupt if falange_militia_strength*falange_militia_militancy > 25 and not falange_militia_banned and not return_to_normalcy

@sa_disrupt

The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Falange**</span> has disrupted our rally! Their street squads are preventing us from meeting.

- @police_protect: Call the Guardia de Asalto to protect our rally.
- @rb_protect: Use the militia to protect our rally.
- @both_protect: The Guardia de Asalto and the militia should work together to protect our rally.
- @cancel: Cancel the rally.

@police_protect
on-arrival: police_protect_success = asalto_loyalty * asalto_militancy * asalto_strength*2 - falange_militia_militancy*falange_militia_strength;
go-to: police_protect_win if police_protect_success >= 0; police_protect_lose if police_protect_success < 0

@police_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The Guardia de Asalto successfully protected our rally, so it can go ahead as usual.

@police_protect_lose
on-arrival: industrial_falange += 3; strife += 1

Unfortunately, the Guardia de Asalto were unable or unwilling to hold back the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Falange**</span> mob. The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Falangists</span> have won this show of strength.

@rb_protect
on-arrival: rb_success = ugt_militia_strength*ugt_militia_militancy - falange_militia_strength*falange_militia_militancy; strife += 1
go-to: rb_protect_win if rb_success >= 0; rb_protect_lose if rb_success < 0

@rb_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The militia has successfully protected our rally against the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Falange**</span>! Our meeting can go ahead as usual.

@rb_protect_lose
on-arrival: industrial_falange += 3; ugt_militia_strength -= 50

Unfortunately, the militia was not able to hold back the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Falange**</span> mob. The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Falangists</span> have won this show of strength.

@both_protect
choose-if: asalto_training > 0
unavailable-subtitle: The loyal sections of the Guardia de Asalto have never coordinated with the militia before.
on-arrival: rb_success = ugt_militia_strength*ugt_militia_militancy - falange_militia_strength*falange_militia_militancy + asalto_loyalty*asalto_militancy*asalto_strength*2; strife += 1
go-to: both_protect_win if rb_success >= 0; both_protect_lose if rb_success < 0

@both_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The Guardia de Asalto and the militia have successfully protected our rally against the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Falange**</span>! Our meeting can go ahead as usual.

@both_protect_lose
on-arrival: industrial_falange += 3; ugt_militia_strength -= 50

Unfortunately, the Guardia de Asalto and the militia were not able to hold back the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Falange**</span> mob. The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Falangists</span> have won this show of strength.

@cancel
on-arrival: industrial_falange += 3;

The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Falange**</span> have won this show of strength.

@main_rally

Mass rallies are a common feature of <span style="color: #c00000;">socialist</span> life in Spain, especially in the lead-up to an election. What is the primary theme of this rally?

- @class_struggle: The class struggle of the proletariat against the bourgeoisie.
- @welfare: Sozialpolitik - the maintenance and expansion of social welfare programs.
- @democracy: Expanding our nascent democracy and defending it against <span style="color: #808080;">dictatorship</span> and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">fascism</span>.
- @pacifism: Opposing war, nationalism, and militarism at all costs.
- @wtb: Support the WTB plan!
- @local: A mixture of various local and national concerns that resonate most with the audience.
- @easy_discard

@class_struggle
on-arrival: industrial_psoe += 4*(1-dissent); industrial_psoe += 2*(1-dissent) if nationalization_adopted; unemployed_psoe += 2*(1-dissent) if nationalization_adopted; unemployed_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if left_strength > reformist_strength; industrial_psoe += 4*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; unemployed_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; left_strength += 5; left_dissent -= 5; smallholder_psoe -= 3; urban_middle_psoe -= 2

Our message of class struggle appeals to the left wing of the working class, while potentially alienating the middle class. [? if nationalization_adopted :  The adoption of the Left’s nationalization plan has done much to revitalize worker enthusiasm. ?][? if nationalization_progress > 0 : Our achievements in nationalization have assisted our messaging. ?]

@welfare
on-arrival: industrial_psoe += 3*(1-dissent); industrial_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_psoe += 4*(1-dissent) if welfare > 1; reformist_strength += 3; labor_strength += 4; reformist_dissent -= 3; labor_dissent -= 3;

The reformist message appeals to the organized workers, whose benefits are the accomplishments of the Prietistas and the <span style="color: #700000;">**UGT**</span>. [? if welfare > 1 : Our achievements in expanding welfare have made this message more effective. ?]

@democracy
on-arrival: democratization += 1; pro_republic += 3*(1 - dissent); industrial_psoe += 2*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; unemployed_psoe += 1*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; urban_middle_psoe += 2*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3

Our speakers defend the Republic and rail against the <span style="color: #808080;">monarchists</span> and <span style="color: #003755;">authoritarians</span> who threaten it.

[? if democratization < 3 : Talk of democracy does not excite the workers as much as more practical issues. But that may change; part of our job is to provide political education to the proletariat. ?]
[? if democratization >= 3 : Since we have consistently made democratization a theme of our campaign, the workers are enthusiastic about our message. ?]

@pacifism
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 3*(1 - dissent); industrial_psoe += 2*(1 - dissent) if pacifism >= 3; unemployed_psoe += 1*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; nationalism -= 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; urban_middle_psoe += 2*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3

Our speakers denounce the officer corps and the colonial war in Morocco, and all the spending entering that black hole. Some adventurous speakers question the army's very role in a democratic Republic.

[? if pacifism < 3 : Given the volume of nationalist indoctrination in our society, it is difficult to argue so vehemently against the military. ?]
[? if pacifism >= 3 : Since we have consistently made pacifism a theme of our campaign, the workers are enthusiastic about our message. ?]

@wtb
view-if: wtb_adopted = 1
choose-if: return_to_normalcy = 0 and (wtb_implemented >= wtb_rally or (not psoe_in_government and not psoe_toleration))
unavailable-subtitle: [? if return_to_normalcy == 1: The economic crisis is largely over now, and the public is no longer interested in hearing about it. ?] [? if wtb_rally > wtb_implemented: Rhetoric alone has its limits; further implementation of the WTB plan is necessary to continue an effective campaign. ?]
on-arrival: industrial_psoe += 3*(1-dissent); unemployed_psoe += 3*(1-dissent); landless_psoe += 1*(1-dissent); urban_middle_psoe += 1*(1-dissent); smallholder_psoe += 1*(1-dissent); industrial_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if wtb_implemented; unemployed_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if wtb_implemented; landless_psoe += 2*(1-dissent) if wtb_implemented; urban_middle_psoe += 2*(1-dissent) if wtb_implemented; smallholder_psoe += 2*(1-dissent) if wtb_implemented; wtb_rally += 1

The WTB plan has become a popular rallying cry for our party. The workers are eager to go back to work, and that is exactly what the plan promises. [? if not wtb_implemented: However, many still believe that the plan is merely an empty slogan and will remain skeptical until we actually implement it. ?]


@local
on-arrival: industrial_psoe += 3*(1-dissent); smallholder_psoe += 1*(1-dissent); urban_middle_psoe += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_psoe += 3*(1-dissent);

Our speakers have gauged the mood and are speaking to the issues that seem to most affect the workers in this moment.
